00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
If you get one percent better each day

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
you will end up thirty-seven times better

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Conversely, if you get one percent worse

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
you will decline nearly down to zero

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
That is the mathematics of tiny habits